## 8. The plugins (the "verbs" of ZTP)

All are Python3, receive one arg (`.../input.json`), read it via `ConfigSection`, and communicate purely by **exit code** (0=SUCCESS, `suspend-exit-code`=SUSPEND, other=FAILED).

| Plugin | Purpose | Key section keys | Touches |
|---|---|---|---|
| **configdb-json** | Apply a `config_db.json` | `url`/`dynamic-url`, `clear-config`(T), `save-config`(F), `overwrite-device-metadata`(F) | `config reload/-load`, CONFIG_DB, restarts interfaces-config |
| **graphservice** | Apply minigraph (+ACL) | `minigraph-url`, `acl-url` | `/etc/sonic/minigraph.xml`, `config load_minigraph`, `config save` |
| **firmware** | Image install/remove/docker-upgrade | `install`/`remove`/`upgrade-docker`, `version`, `set-default`, `pre-check`, `skip-reboot` | `sonic-installer`, reboots |
| **connectivity-check** | Gate until hosts reachable | `ping-hosts`, `ping6-hosts`, `retry-count`(12), `retry-interval`(5) | `ping` |
| **download** | Pre-fetch files | `files:[{url,permissions}]` | `curl --create-dirs`, `chmod` |
| **snmp** | Set SNMP community/location | `community-ro`, `snmp-location`, `restart-agent` | `/etc/sonic/snmp.yml`, restart snmp |
| **test-plugin** | Test harness for engine semantics | `message`, `sleep`, `attempts`+`suspend-exit-code`, `reboot-in-between`, `fail` | drives SUSPEND/reboot/fail paths |

Custom plugins are supported: a section's `plugin` may be a `url`/`dynamic-url`/`name` object, downloaded to `/var/lib/ztp/sections/<sec>/plugin`; `shell:true` runs it via a shell; `umask` overrides the exec umask.

